OL,3,GNEWSAJewellery thief jailed after gun
OL,4,Aand fake cash found in Gucci bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for more than
OL,7,Ffive years after he was found with a
OL,8,Fgun, ammunition and counterfeit cash in
OL,9,Fa Gucci bag.
OL,11,FJason Britton was arrested after he was
OL,12,Fchased near to Glasgow's Hilton hotel
OL,13,Fon 2 December.
OL,15,FThe High Court in Glashow heard that
OL,16,Fthe 35-year-old from Salford, near
OL,17,FManchester, had been in a car with Cade
OL,18,FJohnson, 28, of Manchester, who was
OL,19,Fpreviously jailed over a firearms plot.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
