OL,4,Aand fake cash found in Gucci bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritton was previously jailed for five
OL,7,Fyears and 10 months in 2015 after he
OL,8,Fwas part of a gang who committed a
OL,9,F#230,000 armed heist at Glasgow's
OL,10,FArgyll Arcade.
